{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus / Mimir",
      "description": "Metrics backend that scrapes or receives OTLP from acme2certifier (metrics_export: True).",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "acme2certifier OpenTelemetry metrics overview. Requires [OpenTelemetry] metrics_export: True and OTLP → Prometheus/Mimir (dots become underscores; counters get _total). Label names may vary by collector version — adjust if needed. Trace/log drill-down: use Explore with the TraceQL/LogQL snippets in the bottom panel.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "title": "KPIs",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 100 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Enrolls / min (issuance samples)",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_issuance_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "enrolls/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Issuance p95",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(acme_issuance_duration_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.02 },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.05 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Challenge fail rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_challenge_validation_total{service_name=~\"$service\",acme_outcome=~\"failure|error\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(acme_challenge_validation_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])), 1e-9)",
          "legendFormat": "fail rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "title": "Auth failures / min",
      "type": "stat",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_auth_failure_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "auth failures/min",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Issuance & challenges",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "acme.issuance.duration (p95 by outcome)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(acme_issuance_duration_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (le, acme_outcome))",
          "legendFormat": "{{acme_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "acme.challenge.validation by type / outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_challenge_validation_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (acme_challenge_type, acme_outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{acme_challenge_type}} / {{acme_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "description": "Enrollment completions per minute by acme.cahandler (from acme.issuance.duration). Requires a2c that tags issuance with the handler; series without the label appear as empty.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" }
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "Enrolls / min by handler",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_issuance_duration_count{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (acme_cahandler) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{acme_cahandler}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "id": 102,
      "title": "CA handler & auth",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "acme.ca_handler.call by handler / outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_ca_handler_call_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (acme_cahandler, acme_ca_operation, acme_outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{acme_cahandler}} {{acme_ca_operation}} / {{acme_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 23 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "title": "acme.auth.failure by kind",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(acme_auth_failure_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m])) by (acme_auth_kind)",
          "legendFormat": "{{acme_auth_kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Explore (traces / logs)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## TraceQL (Tempo)\n\n```\n{ resource.service.name=\"$service\" && name=\"acme.certificate.enroll\" }\n{ resource.service.name=\"$service\" && name=\"acme.ca_handler.call\" && status=error }\n{ resource.service.name=\"$service\" && span.acme.outcome=\"error\" }\n```\n\n## LogQL (Loki) — needs `otelTraceID` in `[Helper] log_format`\n\n```\n{service_name=\"$service\"} |~ \"otelTraceID\"\n{service_name=\"$service\"} |= \"`$trace_id`\"\n```\n\nSet `metrics_export: True` in `[OpenTelemetry]`. Point OTLP at Alloy/Collector → Mimir (metrics) + Tempo (traces) + Loki (logs). Jaeger-only installs usually cannot feed these panels.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Drill-down queries",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["acme2certifier", "acme", "opentelemetry", "experimental"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "acme2certifier", "value": "acme2certifier" },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "service.name",
        "name": "service",
        "options": [
          { "selected": true, "text": "acme2certifier", "value": "acme2certifier" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "acme2certifier-ci", "value": "acme2certifier-ci" }
        ],
        "query": "acme2certifier,acme2certifier-ci",
        "type": "custom"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "acme2certifier / ACME overview",
  "uid": "a2c-otel-overview",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
